### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Plan 1 for Gym 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/gyms/{{gym_id_1}}/membership-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plan 1 Power House",
  "plan": "BASIC",
  "monthlyPrice": {
    "amount": 100.00,
    "currency": "PLN"
  },
  "durationInMonths": 1,
  "maxMembers": 100
}
> {% client.global.set("plan_id_1", response.body.id); %}

### 2. Plan 2 for Gym 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/gyms/{{gym_id_1}}/membership-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plan 2 Power House",
  "plan": "BASIC",
  "monthlyPrice": {
