### Get plans for Gym 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/gyms/{{gym_id_1}}/membership-plans

### Get plans for Gym 4
GET {{baseUrl}}/gyms/{{gym_id_4}}/membership-plans

### Get plans for Gym 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/gyms/{{gym_id_2}}/membership-plans